	(text_box "NOTE: Can simplify circuit by making LM2596 push out ~5.3V so that the servo, teensy and CAN Transceiver can all run from the one PSU, can also use MECHA lab 5V buck converter for freeeeeee (but it only does like 1.5A). Otherwise separate, especially if we end up being able to afford an 8V servo (15kg)"
